{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a277c7301130912755dabbdc0c38a60171dd38d06a9acbc5f027034c0b36a651", "ja": "（星梨花の『アイグラ！！』の撮影がもうすぐ始まる。\n今回は、放課後の教室というシチュエーションだ）", "zh": "（星梨花的《偶像写真！！》拍摄马上就要开始了。\n这次的场景是在放学后的教室里。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "50d16a35afa7611737588e906466d85266168d38174ae711fa2a72052f59d96d", "ja": "わぁ……♪", "zh": "哇……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1002_p", "source_sha256": "eb0b82f778ca230e0fb1f96e6420657b3340bf822dc24bcf2e6d9d72b4d55a25", "ja": "楽しそうだな、星梨花。\n何か気になることでもあったか？", "zh": "看起来很开心啊，星梨花。\n是有什么在意的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "d7be48ea5073bb8dbe54f8597c5c83292af7b8a5066e3948e25a0bdf5f9ec6a0", "ja": "はい！　放課後の教室って、こんなに静かなんですね！\n授業を受けている時とは、全然雰囲気が違います。", "zh": "是的！放学后的教室原来这么安静啊！\n和上课时的氛围完全不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d1a00be775dad130e61acb57435b835ace4d53d6bc458f414b9d86c5a5c5dd01", "ja": "確かに放課後の教室は、昼間と違って静かだな。\nけど、そんなに珍しいかな？", "zh": "确实，放课后的教室和白天不一样，安静多了。\n不过，这有那么稀奇吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "cad42b6e01955beb0859298a70d5cf675c656783a57e3b75037dedb8034e94b1", "ja": "とっても珍しいです。わたし、こんなに\n静かな教室にいるのは初めてかもしれません。", "zh": "真的非常少见。我可能还是第一次待在这么安静的教室里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "97448afb1ff5dc9b87ad3c4314af3023e4eb6f4a060641e21c5db5f4ac54dd4f", "ja": "放課後はいつも、習いごとや門限があるから、\nあんまり遅くまで残ったことがなくて……。", "zh": "放学后总是要去上兴趣班，还有限制回家时间，所以我几乎没在学校待到很晚过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1007_p", "source_sha256": "50698718447e9e281acf8ab999ec1e93c92ee04939c38efc85279504d55a03a5", "ja": "なるほど、そうだったのか。\n今は、アイドルとしてのレッスンもあるしな……。", "zh": "原来如此，是这样啊。\n现在还要进行偶像训练了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "a0ac51b24459ca22d592ac3e565500f5fb37043c7b1f7db44bdb0237af8fdc8b", "ja": "でも……この前、レッスンがお休みの日に、\n帰るのがちょっと遅くなったんです。", "zh": "不过……前段时间有一天不用上课，我回去得稍微晚了一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "22c511619744fe0197256297fc4e82cdc58f3dffa6fa3c8d1af853a175bf33f4", "ja": "そうしたらパパから電話が来て、\n学校まで迎えに来ようとしたんですよ。", "zh": "结果爸爸打来了电话，还打算到学校来接我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1010_p", "source_sha256": "82610a0a582d240cc83a8944b4a3cd318bdf7e07c47e7ad12093afa63e011d61", "ja": "はは、そうか。星梨花のお父さんは、\n星梨花の事が心配で仕方がないんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。星梨花的父亲是担心星梨花担心得不得了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "0c52280705f4f0492b40579071e0515157ecccdd67c87fdf3dbaa67b5881fb22", "ja": "そうかもしれませんけど……でもわたし、\nこんなに素敵なものを知らなかったんですね。", "zh": "也许是这样……可是，我竟然一直都不知道世上还有这么美好的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "d6cc5bf4a8ef9a57a227fefb09157485af1a15453b83a5ddcd60c6296e018bfc", "ja": "不思議です。シーンとした教室の中で、わたしと\n{$P$}さんの声だけが聞こえて……。", "zh": "真奇怪。在鸦雀无声的教室里，能听到的只有我的声音和\n{$P$}先生的声音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "5176e33f8f0fbd078a47159e1f7222d580c821063ab07d50d3b9435979db9285", "ja": "学校って大勢の人がいる場所なのに……なんだか、\n世界にわたしたちしかいないみたいです。", "zh": "明明学校里有那么多人……总觉得，\n就好像世界上只剩下了我们一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9573b4b9ae9bde138856590a9c2a7c52c08ca27770f33fcb8a90ea350231d23c", "ja": "うん、そうだな。放課後の教室には、\n秘密がたくさんありそうな気がするよ。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。我总觉得，放学后的教室里好像藏着许多秘密。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "116ed4c378dd5c6a3e0f1c6bf9799ff72eab57cc956d40ff1f96682bf2063263", "ja": "パパがいつも、「授業が終わったら\n早く帰ってくるんだよ」って言うんですけど……。", "zh": "爸爸总是会说：“下课后要早点回家哦。”可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "e8ab7cfbaac1060de1ed65cfeade2eb40c37bb7992a1d544c0c57dfa0f457de8", "ja": "本当は1回くらい、お友達と学校に残ってみたいなって\n思っていたので……今日はとってもうれしいです！", "zh": "其实我一直想着，真想和朋友们一起留在学校里大约1次……所以今天特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0776bef1809e120f0924a42b26d571fe18503cdb0b9a2b920cbbc2c4bda0e2e7", "ja": "そうか。じゃあ今日は、放課後の教室を\nたっぷり体験して、写真に撮ってもらおうな！", "zh": "这样啊。那今天就好好体验一下放学后的教室，再让人帮你拍些照片吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "02aed18a59c900c3950dd1d73eeacb9777f8f456e5805941cd98e8e64241f078", "ja": "はい！　わたし、今日のお仕事もがんばります。\nそれで、終わったらパパに話してみます。", "zh": "好的！我今天的工作也会加油的。\n然后等工作结束后，我会跟爸爸说说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0153_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "31be3b30f9a3d04670b63736c44286dd5b77fced0f739b2f81c2edbb8bf631d9", "ja": "放課後の教室が、とっても素敵なんだってこと！\nパパも、わかってくれるといいな……えへへ。", "zh": "放学后的教室特别棒这件事！希望爸爸也能理解……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
